Package: remote-sudo-touch
Version: 0.1.0
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Paul Kelaita
Depends: bash, python3, systemd
Recommends: openssh-client
Description: RemoteSudoTouch PAM helper for approving sudo via a Mac Touch ID bridge
 Installs the Ubuntu-side PAM helper, a socket-activated local bridge,
 and guided setup tooling for approving sudo via the macOS RemoteSudoTouch
 agent running behind Touch ID.
